  "note": "Gray's share of the Gray-plus-opponent vote at each update of the count. 2022 and 2024 were on the old lines (no Stockton, more of Madera and Fresno), so the same count means the same number of ballots, not the same voters. California counts early mail ballots first, then Election Day ballots, then late mail ballots over the following weeks, and each batch can lean differently. Gaps: no vote counts were reported on election night 2022 (the first one on record is the next morning), and 2024 has no counts on record for Nov 8–12, 14–18 and 22–24. The 2024 election-night point is approximate.",
  "county_note": "By county there are no running counts on record for 2022 or 2024, so this compares Gray's share so far with his final share in the same county (old lines). Merced is the cleanest comparison, since the whole county is in the district both times.",
